ry </span><span begin="00:26.070" end="00:26.430">word </span><span begin="00:26.430" end="00:26.610">you </span><span begin="00:26.610" end="00:27.150">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.180" end="00:28.350"><span begin="00:27.180" end="00:27.330">But </span><span begin="00:27.330" end="00:27.690">they </span><span begin="00:27.690" end="00:28.050">don't </span><span begin="00:28.050" end="00:28.350">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.350" end="00:29.970"><span begin="00:28.350" end="00:28.470">They </span><span begin="00:28.470" end="00:28.950">don't</span><span begin="00:28.950" end="00:28.950">, </span><span begin="00:28.950" end="00:29.190">don't </span><span begin="00:29.190" end="00:29.970">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.180" end="00:32.250"><span begin="00:30.180" end="00:30.690">Secrets </span><span begin="00:30.690" end="00:30.810">that </span><span begin="00:30.810" end="00:30.900">you </span><span begin="00:30.900" end="00:31.200">just </span><span begin="00:31.200" end="00:31.530">can't </span><span begin="00:31.530" end="00:32.250">keep</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.610" end="00:34.560"><span begin="00:32.610" end="00:33.510">Promises </span><span begin="00:33.510" end="00:33.810">that </span><span begin="00:33.810" end="00:33.930">you </span><span begin="00:33.930" end="00:34.260">made </span><span begin="00:34.260" end="00:34.560">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.920" end="00:36.810"><span begin="00:34.920" end="00:35.070">You </span><span begin="00:35.070" end="00:35.460">twisted </span><span begin="00:35.460" end="00:35.580">it </span><span begin="00:35.580" end="00:35.670">to </span><span begin="00:35.670" end="00:36.030">suit </span><span begin="00:36.030" end="00:36.810">yourself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.810" end="00:39.180"><span begin="00:36.810" end="00:36.960">But </span><span begin="00:36.960" end="00:37.380">now </span><span begin="00:37.380" end="00:37.560">I </span><span begin="00:37.560" end="00:37.920">know</span><span begin="00:37.920" end="00:37.980">, </span><span begin="00:37.980" end="00:38.100">I </span><span begin="00:38.100" end="00:38.490">know</span><span begin="00:38.490" end="00:38.550">, </span><span begin="00:38.550" end="00:38.790">I </span><span begin="00:38.790" end="00:39.180">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.700" end="00:46.140"><span begin="00:41.700" end="00:42.480">Everything </span><span begin="00:42.480" end="00:42.750">that </span><span begin="00:42.750" end="00:42.900">I </span><span begin="00:42.900" end="00:43.500">told </span><span begin="00:43.500" end="00:46.140">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.380" end="00:48.240"><span begin="00:46.380" end="00:46.740">You </span><span begin="00:46.740" end="00:46.950">just </span><span begin="00:46.950" end="00:47.460">smile </span><span begin="00:47.460" end="00:47.610">and </span><span begin="00:47.610" end="00:47.910">then </span><span begin="00:47.910" end="00:48.240">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.870" end="00:49.920"><span begin="00:48.870" end="00:49.350">Kiss </span><span begin="00:49.350" end="00:49.530">and </span><span begin="00:49.530" end="00:49.920">tell</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.920" end="00:51.120"><span begin="00:49.920" end="00:50.370">Everything </span><span begin="00:50.370" end="00:50.520">I </span><span begin="00:50.520" end="00:51.120">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.150" end="00:53.940"><span begin="00:51.150" end="00:51.720">Stuck </span><span begin="00:51.720" end="00:52.230">inside </span><span begin="00:52.230" end="00:52.530">your </span><span begin="00:52.530" end="00:53.400">little </span><span begin="00:53.400" end="00:53.940">web</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.940" end="00:58.020"><span begin="00:53.940" end="00:54.840">Everybody </span><span begin="00:54.840" end="00:55.560">wants </span><span begin="00:55.560" end="00:55.920">to </span><span begi